{
  "comment": "Import mapping for Karoryfer's Big Rusty Drums (v1.100, SFZ). The full-kit program is evaluated at its own default controller settings (its mix), with sticks selected (CC25-28 at 0); the snare and 22\" floor tom brushes are read at the brush setting (CC25/CC26 at 80). The hi-hat's openness is a controller on one key (CC4); its quarter-open, half-open and open steps become articulations of their own. Each kit piece's close mic ('cl', 'kick', 'top', 'btm') becomes a mic; 'sn' is the snare wires buzzing under the other drums, recorded by the bottom snare mic. Mechanical noises, stir and flutter techniques and percussive clicks aren't imported.",
